{"id": "EUVD-2026-98707", "enisaUuid": "cd37ff8a-ce00-364e-ba45-6f4bf6c12d40", "description": "FreeRDP 2.3.0 before 3.32.0 dereferences a NULL stream in rdg_process_close_packet in libfreerdp/core/gateway/rdg.c because rdg_process_control_packet accepts a header-only PKT_TYPE_CLOSE_CHANNEL packet and passes the null payload without a check. A malicious or compromised RD Gateway can send an eight-byte CLOSE_CHANNEL header to crash a connecting FreeRDP client.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T13:27:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T21:47:43", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/FreeRDP/FreeRDP/security/advisories/GHSA-f46f-pxh9-w2rh", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/freerdp-2.3.0-before-3.32.0-null-pointer-dereference-via-rd-gateway-close-channel-packet"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hmpv-fgqw-2f74", "CVE-2026-109942"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5ad647c9-e611-39df-8ef5-585fe991917c", "product": {"name": "FreeRDP", "vendor": {"name": "FreeRDP"}}, "product_version": "2.3.0 <3.32.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "61226b7b-d50c-3afb-a87c-39e5c09db4b0", "vendor": {"name": "FreeRDP"}}], "isExploited": false}